ProtocolFeeCollector::setRewardsBps
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when new rewards bps is greater than PERCENTAGE_PRECISION
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorInvalidRewardsBps
    ├── when new rewards bps equals the current rewards bps
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorNoStateChange
    └── when new rewards bps is valid and different
        ├── it should update rewardsBps
        ├── it should allow zero
        ├── it should allow PERCENTAGE_PRECISION
        └── it should emit RewardsBpsUpdated
